{
  "_comment": [
    "A worked storyboard scene for templates/scenes/showcase.html.",
    "Drop this object into a storyboard's `scenes` array. Everything the frame",
    "shows comes from `content` — a different feature is a different `content`,",
    "not a different template.",
    "",
    "Card x/y/w/z are px at 1080p inside the 1010x910 cluster box, whose own",
    "origin sits at (820, 88) in the frame. Omit any of them to take the",
    "kind default. Exactly one card should carry badge.flipTo — that is the",
    "card the second payload lands on, and the flip is timed to its arrival."
  ],

